    "這三項資料將作為日後最高權限操作的憑證，一經設定無法修改，請務必牢記。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "These 3 factors act as your master credentials. They cannot be changed. Memorize them."
